ith `TestAgentImagePins`: read `../../../deploy/agent/Dockerfile`, parse `ARG CLAUDE_VERSION=` and require it to equal `TestedVersion`; require non-empty 64-hex `CLAUDE_SHA256_AMD64` and `CLAUDE_SHA256_ARM64`; the failure message says a `TestedVersion` bump must update the Dockerfile version and checksums in the same PR. Also assert the Dockerfile has no `gh` install or credential helper line.\n5. `docs/proposal.md`: in Delivery add an \"Agent image\" bullet (built locally with `make agent-image`, tagged `ard-agent:dev`, never published to a public registry or GHCR, not built by `ard-build`). In Configuration, near the `Dockerfile` bullet (line ~407), add a sentence that a role Dockerfile should start `FROM` the local image by digest or ID. Add `deploy/agent/` to nothing else; `deploy/` is already protected.\n\n### Test plan\n- `TestAgentImagePins` (`internal/agent/claude/agentimage_test.go`): passes with matching version and two 64-hex checksums; fails if the version differs from `TestedVersion`, a checksum is missing or malformed, or the Dockerfile installs `gh`.\n- Command: `make lint test`.\n- Manual, by a human with Docker (not run by the worker): `make agent-image` then `make agent-image-test`, paste the PASS lines.\n- Edge: unsupported `TARGETARCH` makes the build fail; `gh` absent must be asserted as a failure of `command -v gh`.\n\n### Risk\nMedium-low. Docker build and image test cannot run in the worker's environment, so the Dockerfile is unverified until a human runs it. Touches `deploy/`, which is in `merge.protected_paths`, so merge needs human approval. No change to Go runtime code, `.ard/` config or `ard-build`. Supply chain: checksums must come from the vendor's release, not be guessed.\n\n### Size\nM. Files: `deploy/agent/Dockerfile` (new), `deploy/test-agent-image.sh` (new), `Makefile`, `internal/agent/claude/agentimage_test.go` (new), `docs/proposal.md`.\nEOF\ncat > .ard/243/triage-engineer.md <<'EOF'\n---\nrole: engineer\nstatus: done\nattempt: 1\n---\nAdds a locally built agent image (Dockerfile and test script under deploy/), two Makefile targets, a pin-parity unit test tied to the Claude adapter's tested version, and the proposal text. Size M, risk medium-low.\n\n## Open issues\n- The change touches deploy/, a protected path, so merge needs human approval.\n- The Docker build and image test cannot run in the worker's environment. A human with Docker must run both Makefile targets and post the PASS lines.\n- The worker needs the real release checksums for the pinned CLI version. If it cannot get them, it should stop rather than guess.\nEOF"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3246,"cache_read_input_tokens":18011,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3246},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6629f6eb-a30e-4bf7-a39c-365e453abc49","uuid":"5bcce1d3-ee28-40f8-a3fd-e43e853136a6","timestamp":"2026-11-23T23:13:18.578Z","request_id":"req_011ChLhz99mN1o2iryySW33W"}
